","verse_key":"25:16"},{"pos":6,"ar":"كَانَ","en_gloss":"It is","transliteration":"kāna","verse_key":"25:16"},{"pos":7,"ar":"عَلَىٰ","en_gloss":"on","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"25:16"},{"pos":8,"ar":"رَبِّكَ","en_gloss":"your Lord","transliteration":"rabbika","verse_key":"25:16"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَعْدًۭا","en_gloss":"a promise","transliteration":"waʿdan","verse_key":"25:16"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مَّسْـُٔولًۭا","en_gloss":"requested","transliteration":"masūlan","verse_key":"25:16"},{"pos":11,"ar":"١٦","en_gloss":"(16)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"25:16"}]},{"verse_key":"25:17","surah":25,"ayah":17,"ar_uthmani":"وَيَوْمَ يَحْشُرُهُمْ وَمَا يَعْبُدُونَ مِن دُونِ ٱللَّهِ فَيَقُولُ ءَأَنتُمْ أَضْلَلْتُمْ عِبَادِى هَـٰٓؤُلَآءِ أَمْ هُمْ ضَلُّوا۟ ٱلسَّبِيلَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"On the Day He gathers them all together with those they worship beside Him, He will say, ‘Was it you [false gods] who led these creatures of Mine astray, or did they stray from the path by themselves?’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَيَوْمَ","en_gloss":"And (the) Day","transliteration":"wayawma","verse_key":"25:17"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَحْشُرُهُمْ","en_gloss":"He will gather them","transliteration":"yaḥshuruhum","verse_key":"25:17"},{"pos":3,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"and what","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"25:17"},{"pos":4,"ar":"يَعْبُدُونَ","en_gloss":"they worship","transliteration":"yaʿbudūna","verse_key":"25:17"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"besides Allah","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"25:17"},{"pos":6,"ar":"دُونِ","en_gloss":"besides Allah","transliteration":"dūni","verse_key":"25:17"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"besides Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"25:17"},{"pos":8,"ar":"فَيَقُولُ","en_gloss":"and He will say","transliteration":"fayaqūlu","verse_key":"25:17"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ءَأَنتُمْ","en_gloss":"Did you","transliteration":"a-antum","verse_key":"25:17"},{"pos":10,"ar":"أَضْلَلْتُمْ","en_gloss":"[you] mislead","transliteration":"aḍlaltum","v